# 72. Performance Requirements

Teacher dashboard targets:

### Dashboard

Initial usable interface:

```text
Target: fast initial rendering
```

### Course navigation

Course list should support pagination or virtualization.

### AI Review

Video and review data should load independently where possible.

### Analytics

